%% Phase1 / announcement / MV3-G07b 保存群公告（新建 / 编辑）
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/announcement/mv3-g07b/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/drawer/chat-settings/group-announcement-section/group-announcement-section.component.ts::saveAnnouncement；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::saveAnnouncement
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：有权限的成员在群设置里写一条公告并发布（或编辑已有公告），提交后公告区立刻出现/更新这条公告。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: saveAnnouncement(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_save_announcement", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_save_announcement", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_save_announcement", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 发布或修改群公告 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /post/announcement/save
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction announcement version + list + channel cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（postReceived，POST）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：announcementId 为空串时公告集合 length +1；announcementId 非空时命中同 id 项被替换（集合 length 不变）；保存返回成功后按 G07a 重拉公告绝对列表；列表投影与 ANNOUNCEMENT Post 分别来自权威结果，Angular 不从其中一份补造另一份；ANNOUNCEMENT 消息以 postReceived 进入双侧时间线，会话摘要 lastPost 更新为公告摘要；接收者侧通过 announcementChanged 触发 G07a 重拉后绝对覆盖公告集合
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：不得由 Angular 组装完整 Post、temporaryId、userSnapshot、readBits、viewers、createAt 或发送生命周期；不得与 MV3-G10b（changeChannelSettings(notice)，改的是 channel.props.notice 字段）混为一谈：两者是不同 Gate、不同存储位、不同 Go 端点；无 noticePermission 的成员调用不得写入（权限判定见 MV3-G10g 的 hasPermission；只接受 EPermissionPerson 三值）
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：postReceived，POST；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
